<%--
Bem_Class_Replacement_Survival_Test - Regression test for jquery-plugin.ts:173-185

During $(el).component('New_Component') replacement of an existing component,
classes starting with a capital letter are stripped (they're treated as
component-identity classes), EXCEPT classes containing '__' (BEM-style
classes), which persist across reinitialization. Plain lowercase classes
also always persist.
--%>
<Define:Bem_Class_Replacement_Survival_Test>
  <div class="test-wrap">
    <div $sid="target">Initial Content</div>
    <div id="results"></div>
  </div>
</Define:Bem_Class_Replacement_Survival_Test>
